\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Process-driven semantic enrichment of ORD. A process model (meta level) is mapped onto Clean-ORD resources in the description layer; the mapping deterministically derives four typed fields (\texttt  {capabilities}, \texttt  {useCases}, \texttt  {partOfGroups}, \texttt  {processNext}) that are written back into the resource, producing its Enriched-ORD state in the semantic layer. The resource identity is preserved; only the semantic layer is added.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
